OL,3,GNEWSAThirty people evacuated after flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty people had to be evacuated after
OL,7,Fa flat fire in a four-storey building.
OL,9,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,10,FService said they were called to
OL,11,FHospital Road, Plymouth, after reports
OL,12,Fof flames coming from a first floor
OL,13,Fflat window.
OL,15,FThe force sent eight fire engines to
OL,16,Fthe scene, with seven people rescued by
OL,17,Ffire crews from separate flats.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
