OL,3,GNEWSAThirty people evacuated after flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police said the
OL,7,Fincident started just before 00:00 BST
OL,8,Fon Sunday, and inquiries were ongoing
OL,9,Fto locate an individual wanted in
OL,10,Fconnection with it.
